# The sha256 of many files in this repository is asserted at run time: the frozen sampler and
# ruler modules under crndiff/frozen/ and evaluation/frozen/, the generator checkpoint, and every
# entry of PROVENANCE.json and docs/COPY_MANIFEST.json. Git line-ending normalisation would
# rewrite those bytes on checkout and every guard would fail, so nothing in this repository is
# normalised: the working tree is byte-for-byte what was committed, on every platform.
* -text

# Binary artefacts, marked so no tool tries to diff or convert them.
*.npy    binary
*.npz    binary
*.pt     binary
*.pkl    binary
*.joblib binary
*.pdf    binary
*.png    binary
